TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

Troubleshooting is treated as part of implementation,
not as a separate activity.


Historical troubleshooting cases:

    [x] TRB-001
    [x] TRB-002
    [x] TRB-003


TRB-003:

    Windows machines could reach the gateway and MINT01,
    but DC01 and WIN01 could not ping each other.

    Root cause:

        Windows Firewall did not allow ICMP echo requests
        on the active network profile.

    Resolution:

        ICMP echo was explicitly allowed on both machines.

    Verification:

        [x] DC01 -> WIN01
        [x] WIN01 -> DC01


Troubleshooting documentation location:

